sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant API as API service
    participant DB as Database
    participant R as Redis
    participant V as Other viewers (SSE)

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/actions (Bearer JWT)
    API->>API: Verify JWT, rate limit per user
    API->>DB: INSERT action (id, user_id, status='started', expires_at)
    API-->>U: 201 { actionId, expiresAt }

    Note over U: User performs the action

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/actions/{actionId}/complete<br/>(Bearer JWT)
    API->>API: Verify JWT, rate limit per user
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: SELECT action FOR UPDATE
    API->>API: Check owner = user, status = 'started',<br/>not expired, min duration elapsed
    API->>DB: UPDATE action SET status='completed'
    API->>DB: INSERT score_event (action_id UNIQUE, points)
    API->>DB: UPDATE user_scores SET score = score + points
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API->>R: ZADD leaderboard {rankValue(newTotal)} {userId}
    API->>R: ZREVRANGE leaderboard 0 9
    alt Top 10 changed
        API->>R: PUBLISH scoreboard:updates {top10, version}
    end
    API-->>U: 200 { applied: true, pointsAwarded, score, rank }
    R-->>API: message on scoreboard:updates (every instance)
    API-->>V: SSE event "scoreboard" {top10, version}
    API-->>U: SSE event "scoreboard" {top10, version}
